\`\`\`

### \`tls.l.safe-area\` — Safe Area

Content safe area with configurable inset (editorOnly). _(family: layout; keywords: safe-area, margin, inset, editor)_

**When:** Use in the editor to visually define a content margin zone.
**Avoid:** Do not use in exported decks — it is editor-only and invisible in output.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`inset\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Safe-area inset on all sides. |

