### \`tls.l.section\` — Section

Titled section with divider and content area. _(family: layout; keywords: section, title, heading, divider)_

**When:** Use to introduce a named subsection within a region with a title + divider.
**Avoid:** Do not use for the top-level slide title — use tls.t.title.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`title\` | no | text (max 100 chars) | Section heading text. |
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between title and children. |

