### \`tls.l.sidebar\` — Sidebar

Sidebar + main content layout with configurable width and side. _(family: layout; keywords: sidebar, panel, navigation, two-column)_

**When:** Use to reserve a fixed-width panel on one side for navigation or meta content.
**Avoid:** Do not use for equal-width columns — use tls.l.split or tls.l.grid.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`sidebarWidth\` | no | number (min 100, max 800) | Width of the sidebar panel in slide units. |
| \`gutter\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between sidebar and main content. |
| \`sidebarSide\` | no | enum: start \\\\| end | Place the sidebar on the start (left) or end (right) side. |

