  \\"props\\": {
    \\"sidebarWidth\\": 320,
    \\"gutter\\": \\"md\\",
    \\"sidebarSide\\": \\"start\\"
  },
  \\"children\\": []
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.l.spacer\` — Spacer

Empty space for structural separation. _(family: layout; keywords: spacer, empty, gap, fill)_

**When:** Use to push other blocks apart with intentional empty space.
**Avoid:** Do not use when the gap property on a stack/row already provides spacing.

_No slots._

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_spacer\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.l.spacer\\",
  \\"props\\": {}
}
