### \`tls.l.split\` — Split

Two-panel split with configurable ratio and gutter. _(family: layout; keywords: split, columns, two-panel, sidebar)_

**When:** Use to divide a region into two panels (left/right or top/bottom).
**Avoid:** Do not use for three or more panels — use tls.l.grid instead.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`ratio\` | no | number (min 0.1, max 0.9) | Fraction of space given to the first panel (0.1–0.9). |
| \`gutter\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between panels. |
| \`axis\` | no | enum: x \\\\| y | Split direction: x (left/right) or y (top/bottom). |

